From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:24:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Water, leaves and mesa noise keep no working state in the
 shared block or biome

Audit 2026-11-06 F4, F5, F6: the source count is a local; the leaf scan has a per-thread array of 11 a side instead of a shared one of 32, and waits when its area is not loaded instead of reading the last scan; a mesa column reads the immutable tables of its seed, a few of which are kept. Tables no longer depend on the seed built before them.

